# Tokens Studio — only needed to RE-PULL tokens from your own Studio project.
# The project ships with resolved css/*.css baked in (the default + fallback),
# so the app builds and renders WITHOUT any of this set.
#
# A project-scoped Tokens Studio service token (Settings → Service tokens).
# Long-lived, non-interactive — works for agents + CI. Used by `bun run tokens:pull`.
TOKENS_STUDIO_TOKEN=
